A directory and an explicit Markdown file together make one glob view, the explicit file's file summary in the same one-line format, with all lines sorted by path rather than argument order.
== args
input/docs
input/AGENTS.md
== file input/docs/guide.md
---
description: How to use the tool.
---
# Guide
== file input/AGENTS.md
---
description: Agent instructions.
---
# Agents
== stdout
glob view: input/docs input/AGENTS.md
input/AGENTS.md (4 lines): description: "Agent instructions."
input/docs/guide.md (4 lines): description: "How to use the tool."
== stderr
== exit 0
